      "en": {
        "hook": "Squish, merge, reach 2048.",
        "pitch": [
          "Swipe to slide every jelly, and watch twin tiles stamp into bigger ones. Gold at 128, rainbow at 2048.",
          "It looks sweet, and then the traps arrive. Fireballs and bolts aim at the grid, and you have one move to decide who lands there."
        ],
        "sections": [
          {
            "key": "merge",
            "title": "Swipe and merge",
            "text": [
              "Swipe, and every jelly slides as far as it goes. Two twins that meet stamp into their sum.",
              "From 128 a tile gets a <b>golden</b> edge, and from 2048 it shines rainbow."
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "powers",
            "title": "Wild powers",
            "text": [
              "Fourteen powers join the board one at a time, across five biomes: a bubble bath, a jungle lodge, a crystal cave, rice terraces and a coconut beach."
            ],
            "list": [
              [
                "Tile powers",
                "freeze, petrify, ghost or hide a tile for five moves."
              ],
              [
                "Targets",
                "mark cells of the grid and strike right after your next move."
              ],
              [
                "Sides",
                "a side of the board can turn into a portal or lock shut."
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "modes",
            "title": "Three modes",
            "text": [
              "Climb the map, or just play for the score. And twenty stickers wait to be collected, from a Rubber Duck to a Rainbow 2048."
            ],
            "list": [
              [
                "30 levels",
                "each one asks for a bigger tile, from 128 up to 2048."
              ],
              [
                "Classic",
                "the bathroom with no powers. Play until no move is left."
              ],
              [
                "Fast",
                "reach 2048 as fast as you can."
              ]
            ]
          }
        ],
        "outro": "Press <b>Run game</b> and swipe your first jellies together."
      }
    }
  },
